  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut capsicum into small chunks. <br>• Cut zucchini into thin rounds.<br>• Finely chop or crush garlic. <br>• Roughly chop baby spinach leaves. <br>• Drain and rinse red kidney beans (see ingredients).</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdd93ccf11472438fc55/step-42f01300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook capsicum and zucchini until softened, 2-3 mins.<br>• Stir in garlic, kidney beans, tomato paste and jerk seasoning. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.<br>• Stir in coconut milk, the water and stock powder. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium-low. Simmer until thickened, 4-6 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdd93ccf11472438fc55/step-566b6b10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove from heat and add baby spinach. Stir until wilted. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdd93ccf11472438fc55/step-e2848220.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide Caribbean bean stew between bowls to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdd93ccf11472438fc55/step-4f3eac30.jpg"
    }
  ]
